            <div style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">&#10003; Password &amp; Expiry Gates</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">Client privacy with bcrypt hashing and automatic TTL expiration.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--input-bg);border:1px solid var(--border)">
            <div style="color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px">&#10003; Webhook Automations</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13px">Get HTTP alerts delivered immediately upon milestone clicks or expiration.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

